        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Right Stuff\n- People: Levon Helm, Jack Ridley\n- Roles: Narrator, Air Force test pilot, Aeronautical engineer, USAF test pilot, Chief of the U.S. Air Force's Flight Test Engineering Laboratory\n\nFacts:\n- Jack Ridley was born on June 16, 1915.\n- Jack Ridley was an aeronautical engineer, a USAF test pilot, and chief of the U.S. Air Force's Flight Test Engineering Laboratory.\n- Jack Ridley died on March 12, 1957.\n- The Right Stuff is a 1983 American epic historical drama film.\n- Levon Helm is the narrator in the introduction and elsewhere in The Right Stuff.\n- Levon Helm also co-starred in The Right Stuff as Air Force test pilot Jack Ridley.",
